flowchart TD
    A[Pi Mic Input] --> B[pi/audio/streamer.py\nAGC + gate + mono select]
    B --> C[UDP audio packets\nport 5001]
    C --> D[AudioReceiverService]
    D --> E[audio_queue\nfloat32 16kHz chunks + RMS]
    E --> F[WhisperService segmentation]
    F --> G[Partial transcript callback]
    F --> H{Finalize phrase?}
    H -->|yes| I[Whisper final transcript]
    I --> J[PromptSubmission\nphrase_id + text]
    J --> K[ollama_queue]
    K --> L[OllamaService]
    L --> M[HTTP stream to Ollama /api/generate]
    M --> N[Assistant output tokens in GUI]
